---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Terms" description="The short, friendly ground rules for using Denver Social.">
  <div class="canvas">
    <div class="hp">
      <header class="hp-h">
        <p class="kicker">Terms · Updated 2026-05-20</p>
        <h1>The deal.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Short version: show up, be a good neighbor. That's most of it. The longer version lives below — open whichever section is relevant.</p>
        <a href="/privacy" class="hp-cta">Read the privacy page →</a>
      </header>

      <section class="hp-s">
        <div class="h2-block"><h2>The rules.</h2><p class="h2-cap">Who · What · Removal · Liability · Changes</p></div>

        <details class="card">
          <summary><h3>Who can use this</h3><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary>
          <div class="ans"><p>Anyone 18+ in the Denver metro area. That's the only bar.</p></div>
        </details>

        <details class="card">
          <summary><h3>What you can post</h3><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary>
          <div class="ans"><p>Real events, real flyers, real community happenings. No spam, no hate, no commercial pitches dressed up as meetups. If you wouldn't pin it to a coffee-shop corkboard, don't post it here.</p></div>
        </details>

        <details class="card">
          <summary><h3>What gets removed</h3><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary>
          <div class="ans"><p>Admin can take any page offline at any time, with no appeal. This is a community site, not a platform — there's no obligation to keep anything up.</p></div>
        </details>

        <details class="card">
          <summary><h3>Liability</h3><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary>
          <div class="ans"><p>We don't vet attendees. Meet in public until you trust someone. You are responsible for your own safety and your own choices about who to spend time with.</p></div>
        </details>

        <details class="card">
          <summary><h3>Changes</h3><span class="plus" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i></span></summary>
          <div class="ans"><p>These terms may update over time. Check back occasionally.</p></div>
        </details>
      </section>

      <footer class="hp-foot">
        <p>See also: <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a> · <a href="/contact">Contact</a></p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>

  <style>
    .canvas { background: var(--bg); min-height: 100vh; }

    .hp {
      max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 56px clamp(20px, 5vw, 32px) 96px;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    .hp-h { margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .kicker {
      font-family: var(--font);
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-sec); margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .hp-h h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 64px); font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.035em; line-height: 1.02;
      margin-bottom: 18px; color: var(--text);
    }
    .hp-h h1 em { font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; color: var(--accent); }
    .hp-h h1 .amp {
      font-family: var(--font);
      font-style: italic; font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--text-faint); padding: 0 0.08em;
    }
    .lede {
      font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.55;
      color: var(--text-sec); max-width: 56ch;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .lede a { color: var(--text); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; }
    .lede a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
    .hp-cta {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center;
      font-family: var(--font);
      font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      color: var(--accent); text-decoration: underline;
      text-underline-offset: 5px; text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
      transition: color 280ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);
    }
    .hp-cta:hover { color: var(--accent); }

    .hp-s { margin-bottom: 96px; scroll-margin-top: 88px; }
    .hp-s:last-of-type { margin-bottom: 56px; }
    .h2-block {
      padding-bottom: 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .hp-s h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 36px); font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em; line-height: 1.05;
      color: var(--text); margin: 0;
    }
    .h2-cap {
      font-family: var(--font);
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--text-faint); margin: 6px 0 0;
    }

    .card {
      border: 1px solid rgba(232, 224, 208, 0.8);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
      border-radius: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: background 360ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1), border-color 360ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1), box-shadow 360ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);
    }
    .card:hover { border-color: rgba(220, 208, 184, 0.9); }
    .card[open] {
      background: var(--surface);
      border-color: var(--border);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -4px rgba(28,27,31,0.05);
    }
    .card summary:hover h3 { color: var(--accent); }
    .card summary h3 { transition: color 200ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1); }
    .card summary {
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px; padding: 20px 22px; cursor: pointer;
      list-style: none;
    }
    .card summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
    .card summary h3 {
      font-family: var(--font);
      font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.005em;
      color: var(--text); margin: 0;
    }
    .plus {
      flex-shrink: 0; position: relative;
      width: 20px; height: 20px;
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      transition: transform 360ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1), color 280ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);
      color: var(--text-faint);
    }
    .plus i {
      position: absolute; background: currentColor; border-radius: 2px;
      transition: transform 360ms cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);
    }
    .plus i:nth-child(1) { width: 14px; height: 2px; }
    .plus i:nth-child(2) { width: 2px; height: 14px; }
    .card[open] .plus { color: var(--accent); transform: rotate(90deg); }
    .card[open] .plus i:nth-child(2) { transform: scaleY(0); }
    .ans {
      padding: 4px 22px 22px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(28,27,31,0.06);
      margin-top: 0;
    }
    .ans p {
      font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--text-sec); margin: 14px 0 0;
    }
    .ans p:first-child { margin-top: 14px; }
    .ans a { color: var(--text); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; text-decoration-thickness: 1px; }
    .ans a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
    .ans strong { color: var(--text); font-weight: 600; }

    .hp-foot {
      margin-top: 64px; padding-top: 28px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-sec); text-align: center;
    }
    .hp-foot a { color: var(--text); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
    .hp-foot a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  </style>
</Base>
